{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-03-03 09:30:00', 'title': 'SO SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS SHAREHOLDERS OF THE SOUTHERN COMPANY OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF APRIL 25, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MARCH 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF THE SOUTHERN COMPANY (NYSE: SO) ("SOUTHERN"). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/THE-SOUTHERN-COMPANY-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/ THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED, ACQUIRED, OR OTHERWISE HELD OR SOLD, THE PUBLICLY TRADED SECURITIES OF THE SOUTHERN COMPANY BETWEEN MAY 10, 2013 TO FEBRUARY 20, 2020, INCLUSIVE.'}